+| Mention | `DISCORD_MENTION_ID` → `config('services.discord.mention_id')`: optional Discord user ID (17–20 digits). When valid, every alert ends with `<@ID>` on its own line so it pings that user. Empty or invalid → no mention (anything else, e.g. `@everyone` or multi-line values, is ignored silently) |
